================================================================================
RECOMMENDATIONS
================================================================================
For medical CT images, typical preprocessing is:
1. Resize to target size
2. ToTensor() → converts [0, 255] uint8 to [0, 1] float32
3. Optional: Normalize with mean/std

Common normalizations:
- ImageNet: mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406], std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225]
- No normalization: just [0, 1] range from ToTensor()
- Custom: dataset-specific mean/std

⚠ WARNING: Negative values detected!
  This suggests normalization with mean subtraction.
  Verify training used the SAME mean/std values.

